abstract: >
  Intentional Symbolic Pre-Cognitive Computing framework implementing
  the 3-Stage Intentional MaxiMin method and Predictive Regime-split Intentional Symbolic MaxiMin. Variables are classified by
  dynamical character (π-type cascade, e-type equilibrium) and encoded
  with transcendental basis functions derived from dynamical systems
  theory before any learning algorithm engages.
